# Manuscript snapshots, downloaded paper full texts and render QA are local.
manuscript/**/qa/
manuscript/**/sources/
manuscript/**/archive/
manuscript/**/supplementary_data/
manuscript/**/submission_data/
manuscript/**/submission_data_corrected/
